  "source_pdf": "downloads/pigsys-boing-boing-band-v3.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "ed84744880ff65f0890fcccda6d428487bc0f5f5e1c90bdc9afce926c24a6929",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b80ce9f375c911b6921ae88087388361fe55bd87dfd298bae32a7f4babf6760f",
      "text": "Pigsy’s\nBoing-Boing Band",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "011468f698080bbed5814875591ff830f82620e4f3935d16eb0f64e3fde449da",
      "text": "Pigsy makes a frog from a\nbig box.\nIt has a big, round belly.\n“Every frog needs a boing!”\nsays Pigsy.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4502bef4cda4728820a924697c9ecfce7f4a8f3cdef4ec14b6d059dd72732cd9",
      "text": "Sandy helps.\nHe stretches two wide rubber\nbands across the frog’s mouth.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a5d084fb7cc3137039c383f88b88f8876a257bbf512a42ada6af886ba9b246e4",
      "text": "Wukong plucks one band.\nBoing! The frog hums.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b87c88751a857231980c72f380722cbde89cb95dafbee3ca77fb18783857e3ad",
      "text": "He presses the band to\npluck again.\nThe sound stops!\n“Froggy, why did you stop?”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f08db35ce2f267ad586d336eafc5b2f7c0d06e6bb3276370b6ad8a853ccbc263",
      "text": "Pigsy pats the frog.\n“Are you sleepy, Froggy?”\nThe frog says nothing.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2c966a72cb55fa7bdbd2d18c308fc04cd22d5940b40dec5af5e940a1768fc586",
      "text": "Nezha has an idea.\n“Let’s watch and listen.\nPluck it again, and look at\nthe band.”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4d88deb5693f2b9ec31fd5804d38274f73bb821bf796d64d5dbe6cd57fbb6243",
      "text": "Boing! The band shakes so\nfast, it looks blurry.\n“It vibrates,” says Nezha.\n“That makes the sound.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "25ce5e9171d7d2fa3f84f82bdd2e55c126a597892315f5961327da045fe29ea9",
      "text": "Wukong presses the band.\nIt stops vibrating.\nThe sound stops too.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8fa2f8ab16762ea2099860718bf1685a58213606e257c5454f63e0664a262df2",
      "text": "Pigsy plucks and touches\nthe box.\nBuzz! He can feel it shake.\n“It tickles!” says Pigsy.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "96692bee07e3952204d652ae53ecebeec0b2b52eb8abab00589e22eb31bf8765",
      "text": "Now they pluck both bands.\nBoing! Boing!\nWukong holds one band still.\nOnly one sound is left.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d670a8a3998c25a758196725c4dfa4c51b1412b1213c5a5951a18abce3e8ffdf",
      "text": "“Shaking band, boing!”\nsays Wukong.\n“Still band, quiet!”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3df90ccec96075ec9bcab48047dfd4e02ddd81b7b0d165d59a029cf8d7463100",
      "text": "Pigsy wants a big,\nloud concert.\nHe reaches to pull the band\nway back.\n“Gentle plucks,” says Sandy.\n“The frog likes soft songs.”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c63aad4a5d05b87689d74364a3e797d919ac3bf8d799d7850934476d8f50fe85",
      "text": "Pigsy plucks one band.\nNezha plucks the other.\nWhen Wukong says “Stop!”,\nthey hold the bands still.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ee7d83caee34f2093db5f19e132f2f31cbe14e4138e4715055158839f33c70ca",
      "text": "Boing, boing… stop!\nBoing… stop!\nIt is a quiet little song.\nSandy claps softly.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "66090fe5dacf54f0c8db0ee1c72b094fb1cb9c0580d6c2b131dcfc133be814ea",
      "text": "Pigsy bows to the frog.\nGrumble! goes his tummy.\n“A new sound!” says Wukong.\n“Snack time!” says Pigsy.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cc57f9806e9e3bcd4ddbc32e908cb2e12b574361756d6b487aac96bfbe18d08e",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
