      "sha256": "7e07376dcc823b8ff03c28a78619523f6b5a640217cf98582989ec295ea07dad",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nPluck it: boing!\nHold it: quiet.\nCan you feel it shake?\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends",
